{"type":"message","id":"6ebfd67d","parentId":"0cd5cc78","timestamp":"2026-05-27T06:37:06.542Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"从源码看，hermes 支持 anthropic provider，使用 anthropic 的 messages API。Kimi 的 agent-gw.kimi.com/coding 端点也使用 anthropic-messages 格式。\n\n让我看看 hermes 如何根据 provider 选择客户端：\n- 如果 provider 是 \"anthropic\"，它会用 anthropic_adapter 构建 anthropic 客户端\n- 但 hermes 的 provider 可能不是随意设置的，需要看是否支持自定义 anthropic base_url\n\n让我看看 hermes 的 provider 注册逻辑，看看如何把 provider 设为 \"anthropic\" 并自定义 base_url。\n\n让我查看 hermes 中 provider 的解析逻辑。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_jL7QlS2JA3k7sEzAUnvLYoo3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -r \"_anthropic_base_url\\|provider.*anthropic\\|anthropic_adapter\" /usr/local/lib/hermes-agent/run_agent.py 2>/dev/null | head -40"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"kimi-coding","model":"k2p5","usage":{"input":1258,"output":196,"cacheRead":48151,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49605,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779863821172}}
