{"type":"message","id":"e01c36f7","parentId":"831dc4a0","timestamp":"2026-05-27T06:50:54.168Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"这很有趣！`hermes auth list` 显示：\n1. `anthropic` 有一个 credential，source 是 `env:ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`（但这个环境变量现在已经被改成 `OPENAI_API_KEY` 了，所以这个 credential 可能已经失效）\n2. `kimi-coding` 有一个 credential，source 是 `env:KIMI_API_KEY`！\n3. `openai-api` 有一个 credential，source 是 `env:OPENAI_API_KEY`\n\n但 `kimi-coding` 的 credential 的 `base_url` 是什么？从 `auth.json` 我们看到 `kimi-coding` 的 credential pool 是空的 `[]`。但 `hermes auth list` 显示有一个。\n\n这说明 `hermes auth list` 可能是从环境变量动态推导的，而不是从 `auth.json` 读取的。\n\n关键发现：`kimi-coding` 的 credential 标签是 `KIMI_API_KEY`，这意味着 hermes 期望 `KIMI_API_KEY` 环境变量存在。但我们的 `.env` 文件中只有 `OPENAI_API_KEY`，没有 `KIMI_API_KEY`！\n\n解决方案：\n1. 在 `.env` 中添加 `KIMI_API_KEY`（使用相同的 key）\n2. 或者删除 `anthropic` 的 credential，防止它干扰\n\n让我看看 hermes auth 的更多选项，以及如何删除 credential。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_v0CP511LJISZObYF5ewgdEXZ","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"hermes auth remove --help 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"kimi-coding","model":"k2p5","usage":{"input":262,"output":325,"cacheRead":73603,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":74190,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779864644729}}
